Mi5G TV (phone app): third-party notices

Mi5G TV (`com.midroid.mi5gtv`) is an Arabic-first Android edition based on Clean Your TV (phone app)
by udhaykumarbala (https://github.com/udhaykumarbala/cleanyourtv-app, MIT License) and Clean Your TV
by Gathin (https://github.com/Gathin23/cleanyourtv, MIT License).

The app is MIT licensed (see LICENSE). It contains, or is built with, the following third-party
work. The full licence texts are linked or included below.

1. Clean Your TV launcher (bundled TV launcher APK, com.gathin.tvhome)
   https://github.com/Gathin23/cleanyourtv, tag v2.5.0, commit 9071ec8d2f41826778f6b4c7f5f42dadc22f5b22
   (the third_party/cleanyourtv submodule). The APK in android/platform/src/main/assets/bundled is
   built from that commit without changes and re-signed with this project's launcher key. The
   upstream repository's per TV clean-up lists, written by its community contributors, are
   converted into this app's TV profiles, and three of its themes (default, aurora with its
   wallpaper picture, six-columns) are bundled as they are. Licence: MIT. The aurora wallpaper
   is the upstream author's own work; he confirmed on 2026-10-23 that it is MIT like the rest.

